commit f106005cdef9e1aa2a6e907468bc3ec2202506da

C03: four composer vetoes no longer hide a faithful weather search report (WEB1449)

WEB1447 measured that every draft over the verified weather searches described the pages found faithfully («Encontré varias páginas que ofrecen información sobre el clima en …: "Clima en … - Temperatura por horas" de clima.com, …») and that no final was published because of four vetoes that had nothing to do with truth.

baxy_mind llm:
- _truncated_fact_word: a result snippet is prose, not a name; «clima actual» is no longer a cut of the snippet word «actualizada».
- _payload_fact_defect: the word grounding veto search_unsupported_terms is removed (it rejected «existen», «diferentes», «específica», «concretos»); search_unsupported_claim (a weather assertion no result states verbatim) and search_result_denied (denying verified results) stay, with their hints.
- compose_visible_defect: for a verified web.search the quoted result titles and hosts are masked before the question check, so «"Tiempo en Santiago mañana — ¿Va a llover? | tiempo.cl"» is an observed name and not a question; the honest scope «No puedo confirmar si va a llover mañana porque los resultados solo proporcionan pronósticos…» is masked from the failure lens for a verified search with results (an invented forecast or a denial is still vetoed on the payload).

Offline probe on the WEB1447 receipts: all fourteen vetoed drafts of runs 00–06 now pass; the WEB1445 invented finals («Hoy hace buen tiempo…», «Hoy está soleado…», «Mañana va a llover…») and the denials stay vetoed; the six WEB1271 news finals still pass. Mind only (BUILD1449). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


